est; (d) GAP-024 total = unlimited deduped match count (NOT the raw scan count — see the 246,075 trap above); (e) `pnpm vitest run tests/` green on the foreman's implementation.", "completed_at": "2026-09-29T03:55:00-05:00", "worker_status": "complete", "commit_hash": "0b5be05", "worker_summary": "glm-5.3-flash@zai-glm worker: queryMemoriesWithTotal() combined API (dedup-window COUNT(*) OVER () pre-LIMIT), recall.ts hot path + retry block converted; countMemories retained for other callers", "files_changed": "src/duckdb/queries.ts, src/mcp/tools/recall.ts, src/duckdb/queries-fused-total-perf003.test.ts (new, 233L), AGENTS.md count sync", "lines_added": 448, "lines_removed": 34, "guard_result": "gitreins tier2 judge 7cb5897e PASS (tier1 passed; verdict COMPLETE); suite 183/184 pass 1464/1464 (gap046 config-ordering flake greens solo), tsc clean, prettier clean", "foreman_note": "AGENTS.md counts 183/1458 -> 184/1464 synced foreman-direct via sanctioned toggle (restored true); full-suite gap046 failure = config-ordering contamination, solo green, pre-existing class"}
