 {"id": "NAMESPACE-AUTOCREATE-001", "priority": "P3", "status": "pending", "created_at": "2026-09-27T17:19:56.350579+00:00", "created_by": null, "complexity": 1, "title": "P3 \u2014 Writing to a non-existent namespace silently creates it (src/mcp/tools/remember.ts:254 mkdirSync recursive + first-write git-init): a typo in ?namespace= scatters memories into a new namespace with no error or confirmation.", "reasoning": "Third-party review (carterlasalle), fresh clone of feat/native-s3 @ 39f0b4f, scratch daemon :3191 (auth=apikey). MEASURED: POST /api/memories?namespace=ghostns with no prior create -> HTTP 201, namespace dir + .git created on disk. README quickstart does explicit POST /api/namespaces first, implying creation is explicit; the implicit path is undocumented and a typo'd namespace silently orphans memories.", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T17:19:56.350579+00:00", "detail": {"fingerprint": "89834b33536c9650ecdef6a6ba10a523aee90f3c6b734f2131f2c712dab31e8d"}}
 {"id": "HEALTH-KEYS-UNDEFINED-001", "priority": "P2", "status": "pending", "created_at": "2026-09-27T17:19:56.379685+00:00", "created_by": null, "complexity": 2, "title": "P2 \u2014 Fresh-install /health is permanently degraded (503) with keys_error 'Namespace undefined does not exist': probeKeysStore() (http.ts:256) passes no namespace, list_keys.ts:172 interpolates the raw undefined instead of the resolved default, and an empty store is treated as degraded not healthy.", "reasoning": "MEASURED on fresh isolated daemons :3189 and :3191 @ 39f0b4f: /health returns HTTP 503 body status=degraded keys_error='Namespace undefined does not exist' even with embedding.healthy=true (lmstudio+ollama both ok), because the default namespace has not been created yet. Root cause is the raw-undefined interpolation plus empty-store-as-degraded. Cross-ref README-5 (docs). Fix: resolve the namespace name before interpolating, and treat a missing-but-empty default store as healthy.", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T17:19:56.379685+00:00", "detail": {"fingerprint": "639591a598000230fd691adaaa46f0d09f3bd232036b1281bdecd1ceee117dbe"}}
